### Hello
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hello

### Sign up
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123"
}

### Sign in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ejavlon",
  "password": "root"
}

